# Third-Party Licenses

This document reproduces the license texts of the open-source dependencies
bundled in csq, satisfying the attribution obligations of the permissive
licenses (MIT / BSD / ISC / Apache-2.0 and others) under which those
dependencies are distributed.

It is generated by `scripts/generate-third-party-licenses.sh` (via
[`cargo-about`](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)) against the
default (`cli` + `desktop`) dependency tree. Regenerate after any dependency
change. Do not edit by hand.

This list covers third-party crates plus csq's own crates that are published to
crates.io as standalone Apache-2.0 packages (`csq-sdk`, `csq-redact`) — those are
attributed here because a redistributor of the csq binary redistributes them as
separately-licensed crates. First-party crates that are NOT published to crates.io
(csq-core, csq, and the enterprise crates) are licensed under `LICENSE` and are
not listed here.

